<title>BRAZIL: Injunction blocking Banerj sale revoked - Rio state.</title>
<headline>Injunction blocking Banerj sale revoked - Rio state.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A court injunction blocking Tuesday's privatization auction of Rio de Janeiro state bank Banerj was revoked, a spokesman for the Rio state Finance Secretariat said.</p>
<p>The injunction had been granted by a Rio state judge at the request of a bank employees union.  </p>
<p>The auction, however, still depends on a Senate approval of a deal resolving Banerj's pension and payroll-related debts.</p>
<p>Banerj was scheduled to be auctioned off at 1400 local/1700 GMT on the Rio de Janeiro Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom 5521 5074151))</p>
